# Only the RetroByte posting pipeline + generated media are allowed.
# Block everything else by default (keeps secrets out of this public repo).
# NOTE: .env.retrobyte is NEVER here — it's mounted from /home/pcmedicalist/.pcmedicalist/
# at runtime. Runtime state (.retrobyte_post_state.json) is also excluded.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!post_retrobyte_social.py
!retrobyte_discovery_video.py
!retrobyte_scheduler.py
!retrobyte_heal.sh
!RETROBYTE FRESH DISCOVERY TOPICS.md
!media/
!media/**
!.discovery_state.json


# Offline regression coverage for scheduled video generation.
!tests/
!tests/test_generation_media.py

# Stationary diffusion renderer and its regression coverage.
!retrobyte_still_scene.py
!retrobyte_still_video.py
!tests/test_still_video.py
!STILL_VIDEO_PIPELINE.md

# Review media is separate from the social poster input directory.
!reviews/
!reviews/retrobyte-palmpilot-still-review-20261018.mp4
